{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM J\u00E4mf\u00F6r olika metoder\n\nPROFILE START \u0022Method1\u0022\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  height = SIN(i * 0.05) * 30 \u002B SIN(i * 0.02) * 50\nNEXT i\nPROFILE END \u0022Method1\u0022\n\nPROFILE START \u0022Method2\u0022\nREM Pre-calculate outside loop\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  angle1 = i * 0.05\n  angle2 = i * 0.02\n  height = SIN(angle1) * 30 \u002B SIN(angle2) * 50\nNEXT i\nPROFILE END \u0022Method2\u0022\n\nPRINT \u0022Method1 time: \u0022 \u0026 TIME_Method1 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Method2 time: \u0022 \u0026 TIME_Method2 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Speedup: \u0022 \u0026 TIME_Method1 / TIME_Method2 \u0026 \u0022x\u0022"}